ata-bl-label=\"Your account\"><h2 id=\"account-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Your account</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign-in is by invitation. Use your own email or phone, or the social sign-in option, only to access your household’s information. Do not try to sign in as someone else.</span></p></section><section id=\"content\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"content-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Photos and messages\"><h2 id=\"content-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Photos and messages</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos, stories, and uploads may include people who expect privacy at a wedding. Do not repost others’ images or details without their permission. Professional and guest media on the site may carry separate rights — see</span><!-- --> <a href=\"/credits\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photo credits</span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></p></section><section id=\"availability\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"availability-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Availability\"><h2 id=\"availability-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Availability</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We try to keep the site running smoothly but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. Features may change as the weekend approaches.</span></p></section><section id=\"privacy\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Privacy\"><h2 id=\"privacy-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Privacy</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our </span><a href=\"/privacy\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Privacy</span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> page describes what we collect and how to ask for changes or deletion.</span></p></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" 